@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor White
skinparam usecaseBorderColor Black
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 85
usecase "robotis::turtlebot3::TurtleBot3" as Robot
usecase "rclcpp::Node\n(LD19 driver; class inferred)" as Lidar
usecase "project1::ros2::WallFollowerNode" as Follower
usecase "robotis::turtlebot3::DiffDriveController" as Odom
Lidar --> Follower : /scan : LaserScan
Robot --> Odom : /joint_states : JointState
Robot --> Odom : /imu : Imu
Odom --> Follower : /odom : Odometry
Follower --> Robot : /cmd_vel : TwistStamped
note bottom
Physical bringup: turtlebot3_bringup, LDS_MODEL=LDS-04, LDROBOT LD19.
The LD19 ROS node class is inferred from upstream; verify the installed driver.
Optional RViz consumes /trajectory : Path and /scan : LaserScan.
Middleware discovery and diagnostic topics are omitted.
end note
@enduml
